OL,5,
OL,6,FGross domestic product (GDP) is a
OL,7,Fmeasure of all the economic activity of
OL,8,Fcompanies, governments, and people
OL,10,FFigures for the second quarter of the
OL,11,Fyear, from April to June, showed the
OL,12,Feconomy grew by 0.5%
